WEBVTT

00:04:58.627 --> 00:05:01.756
there has been an evolution
in the labor movement.

00:05:02.298 --> 00:05:04.091
Craft unions,

00:05:04.091 --> 00:05:07.094
think construction work
or even beer making,

00:05:07.136 --> 00:05:09.680
emerged from medieval guilds.

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:15.019
With the rise of industry --
auto, steel --

00:05:15.061 --> 00:05:18.898
new forms of organization emerged.

00:05:20.566 --> 00:05:26.197
When white collar workers in offices,
in government, in health care

00:05:26.238 --> 00:05:28.240
in professions,

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:32.244
won voice and representation,